== 2. two applies in the same second, then rollback twice

$ mandrake link apply   # rules -> a
  links: backuplink  rules -> $T/a
  journal $T/mh/state/journal/20261025-011300-001.json

$ mandrake link apply   # rules -> b, same second
  links: relink      rules -> $T/b
  journal $T/mh/state/journal/20261025-011300-002.json

$ ls state/journal
  20261025-011300-001.json
  20261025-011300-002.json

$ mandrake link rollback
  rolled back 1 steps

$ mandrake link rollback
  rolled back 1 steps

$ readlink ~/.claude/rules || ls ~/.claude/rules
  folder: original.txt

verdict: FIXED two journals, and two rollbacks bring the original folder back
